body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1452. Reported on published 2026.10.12 with a directed persistent ships_before kind; activation and graph discovery succeed, while --dep id=sr-b,kind=ships_before fails. Downstream pm-gantt-chart issue 135 reportedly seeds files directly as a workaround. Current mutation behavior has not yet been independently reproduced during this intake; do not edit real tracker files or bypass registry validation."
